      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "And now a release is available: https://github.com/ytdl-org/youtube-dl/releases\n\nYou can update before the VRChat release with: \n\"C:\\Program Files (x86)\\Steam\\steamapps\\common\\VRChat\\VRChat_Data\\StreamingAssets\\youtube-dl.exe\" -U\n\nOr by replacing the youtube-dl.exe above with the release from GitHub. Seems to fix the problems with Video Players from my testing.",
      "viewerReactions": null
